{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c6d01c8a05967237a7dbfe827652c7f1.avif?t=1759975112\" width=964 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D roguelite deckbuilder adventure where every step counts. <br>Explore a procedurally generated world and build the best version of your hero and deck to overcome every challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore maps filled with events, quests, and encounters that make each run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a one-of-a-kind tactical combat system with positional cards that reward strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your hero with over 3,200 armor combinations and progressive upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergies between your cards and tailor your deck to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your wits in increasingly tough battles until you reach the ultimate tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/252f504413594086e5c96abfea8eba52.avif?t=1759975112\" width=1500 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards strategically to maximize synergies and counter your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE THE WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across grid-based maps, discover villages, treasures, and unique events that shape your adventure with every step.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR HERO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade each piece of your character\u2019s equipment and unlock thousands of possible combinations. Let your hero grow alongside your deck until you\u2019re prepared for any opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c296965b0f7e01f49a7c463fc8f16077.poster.avif?t=1759975112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c296965b0f7e01f49a7c463fc8f16077.webm?t=1759975112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c296965b0f7e01f49a7c463fc8f16077.mp4?t=1759975112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938290?t=1759975112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/f4224b3f6d4edbcc9e07c8c17bd7e14f109466e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759975112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759975112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759975112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3941190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3